{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "GeographicProjection",
      "field": "classdesc",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:90cefd8a27c0f02d549c804929426e3c1a15e5043a6b8eda66b79ee662352294",
      "text": "将经度和纬度分别乘以 {@link Ellipsoid#maximumRadius}，线性映射为 X、Y 的简单地图投影。通常称为地理投影、等距圆柱投影或 plate carrée；使用 WGS84 椭球时，也称为 EPSG:4326。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeographicProjection",
      "field": "params/ellipsoid/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:d4987f5b4d3b55df0ddb3f54009edf4bc5f1decfcd20d213883232e3abcc7dd4",
      "text": "椭球。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeographicProjection#ellipsoid",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:c2cf9f852d326a8bb4f4372ffbb6add3d5d86466688be99f3beaaf020501e57a",
      "text": "获取 {@link Ellipsoid}。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeographicProjection#project",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:d711f4cfce9c3e3df88c310c705f98d144aa29fb974af0b1b0eac89cc2d0a33c",
      "text": "将以弧度为单位的 {@link Cartographic} 坐标投影为米制地图坐标。X、Y 分别为经度和纬度乘以椭球最大半径，Z 保持原高度不变。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeographicProjection#project",
      "field": "params/cartographic/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:236d6c8caeca91869e2e116bfd73994dfce44de9de680e77cd0426da3b5d346c",
      "text": "要投影的坐标。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeographicProjection#project",
      "field": "params/result/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:ad9837379d3b79d17796625f0c3c55eb2da4a56be968d8eda1c639636f7b6e32",
      "text": "用于接收结果的实例；若为 undefined，则创建并返回新实例。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeographicProjection#project",
      "field": "returns/0/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:cf7375b4d831ef73c0e9f45e87d6273978d625359fe5e2d756477e2535c6817c",
      "text": "投影后的坐标。若 result 不为 undefined，则复制到该实例并返回；否则创建并返回新实例。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeographicProjection#unproject",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:8676b32d1b0576b54b6ee436db0ebc2e73f0d1ccd7b2e4dc195d7e0a9062ccf4",
      "text": "将以米为单位的投影 {@link Cartesian3} 坐标反投影为以弧度为单位的 {@link Cartographic} 坐标。经度和纬度分别为 X、Y 除以椭球最大半径，高度保持原 Z 不变。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeographicProjection#unproject",
      "field": "params/cartesian/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:1f8f1b4049dc058a87b8fb8faca28ac3a946efe03c7416f58db21b8e67785818",
      "text": "要反投影的笛卡尔位置，其高度 z 使用米。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeographicProjection#unproject",
      "field": "params/result/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:ad9837379d3b79d17796625f0c3c55eb2da4a56be968d8eda1c639636f7b6e32",
      "text": "用于接收结果的实例；若为 undefined，则创建并返回新实例。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeographicProjection#unproject",
      "field": "returns/0/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:0c1e1429832522ea4570a478bd63e0fd9a3f01a59bed4a20ad16fc1d98494ed1",
      "text": "反投影后的坐标。若 result 不为 undefined，则复制到该实例并返回；否则创建并返回新实例。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeographicTilingScheme",
      "field": "classdesc",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:dd38bbb8126097439dc8aeeb88611749c74f78adfade54caf9f5103a3e8ab512",
      "text": "用于基于简单 {@link GeographicProjection} 的几何分块方案，经纬度直接映射到 X、Y。此投影通常称为地理投影、等距圆柱投影或 plate carrée。"
    },
